--- !u!114 &1499225634
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1499225632}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 5


    The pump room. The door bolt hangs

    on a chain over to a
    bucket. Fill

    the bucket, the bolt comes up.

    It never fills in one breath.


    There
    was a body by the bucket

    when I came in. Same boots as mine.

    I didn''t
    look at the face.'
--- !u!23 &1499225635
